# NFT Marketplace Aggregation

`Lux.Integrations.NFT.MarketplaceAggregator` normalizes marketplace data for NFT
collections and builds aggregate reports across OpenSea, Blur, X2Y2, and custom
marketplaces.

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.NFT.MarketplaceAggregator

MarketplaceAggregator.aggregate(%{
  collection_slug: "azuki",
  contract_address: "0xed5af388653567af2f388e6224dc7c4b3241c544",
  marketplaces: [
    %{
      marketplace: "opensea",
      stats: %{floor_price: 4.5, volume_24h: 100.0, listed_count: 10},
      listings: [%{token_id: "1", price: 4.5}],
      sales: [%{token_id: "1", price: 4.7}],
      tokens: [%{token_id: "1", traits: %{"Background" => "Red"}}]
    }
  ]
})
```

The aggregator is transport-free. Use `request_plans/1` to plan collection,
listing, and sale reads for each marketplace, execute those requests in the
caller-controlled transport layer, then pass the returned payloads into
`aggregate/1`.
